    "directions": [
      "In a large pot, fry onions and garlic.",
      "Add the potatoes and carrots, and mix. Then add 2 c of broth to cover, simmering until potatoes are soft (around 15 mins).",
      "Transfer soup into blender and blend. Then transfer back into the pot.",
      "Blend 1 c of broth, cashews, nutritional yeast, paprika, ground mustard, lemon juice, miso paste and tomato paste until smooth. Add mixture into the pot and mix.",
      "Lastly, combine the streamed or roasted broccoli and cooked macaroni and mix. Add salt and pepper to taste."
    ],
